      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside in the restaurant courtyard, a television crew is filming a portrait of Chef Viktor Barinov as he inspects a delivery from Timur and trades barbs with rival chef Elena Pavlovna. Let's hear the dialogue in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
